{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:30 2026-09-20 HKT</p>\n\n<p>76歲的薛家燕近日被網民捕獲現身睇樓，最新造型更瞬間掀起全網熱話。日前有網民在社交平台上載多張薛家燕參觀豪宅的照片，最引人注目的莫過於薛家燕一改以往經典形象，罕有脫下假髮，以一頭自然微鬈的真髮示人。雖然薛家燕卸下假髮後，髮量略見稀疏，但感覺相當隨和自然，睇樓當天薛家燕身穿粉紅色長袖套裝，面色紅潤，笑容親切，不少網民看過照片後紛紛驚呼「差啲唔認得家燕姐」，激讚薛家燕毫無明星架子。</p>\n<h2>薛家燕睇樓照流出鍾情南區</h2>\n<p>薛家燕當日參觀的豪宅單位極具氣派，從曝光的照片可見，該單位寬敞闊落，巨廳外連特大景觀露台，採光度十足，從單位及露台向外望，可將翠綠山景盡收眼底，視野極為開揚。薛家燕在室內及露台多個角落駐足打卡，神情顯得相當滿意。網民憑窗外景觀，指出該單位與港島南區鴨脷洲一帶的頂級豪宅極為相似，事實上，薛家燕向來鍾情南區的生活環境，過去亦曾在區內置業，今次再度現身睇樓，隨即引來外界猜測薛家燕有意再度入市進駐南區。</p>\n<img alt=\"有指薛家燕手持最少9個物業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd6d63d9f0e4be287e362221bf18bc28/2023-07/130a6241.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕已在新城電台開咪多年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ea123a08793bc5a979f4b840361a966/2024-05/kayinsit_1711515461_3332755703608601544_1237608089.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕是童星出身，是「七公主」之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bd8316fcd333fadc817d682fbf031e2d/2023-09/sdm15p07120502.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近日網傳薛家燕睇樓照，相中她安坐於落地大玻璃窗台上，盡覽窗外翠綠山景與海景，神情愜意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3426017adc90c37e4bb69461b7b81800/2026-09/810090686_17986925697115430_6956468094121107458_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕站於豪宅露台，身後是住宅大樓，景觀開揚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0245bed303663ddc1bcab962eba39594/2026-09/810246553_17986925793115430_6270941367970611040_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕在寬敞的客廳自拍，似乎十分滿意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/628e4eb5577a5a106d8d5e6ceca71d57/2026-09/810813932_17986925688115430_2125182154535555971_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕一身招牌粉紅裝束，在露台感受開揚景觀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff0ac4e8b1a91c909b71b5ea8d06099c/2026-09/811102800_17986925763115430_8123473971877905701_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕從露台遠眺，可望見翠綠山景，心曠神怡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a760935a8b2fbc756fc8221ce8fec22/2026-09/811266635_17986925811115430_6356952336621756238_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕在單位內的廚房打卡，廚房設計時尚簡約。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3a729a66f01ddaa06b3abf17e305c1b/2026-09/811748370_17986925712115430_4609511014592359729_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"巨型窗戶將戶外山海景致引入室內，採光度十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6eae37d709bffcba054b85debc17cd5b/2026-09/811994214_17986925745115430_712126662220983202_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕於8月初出席楊明及莊思明在馬來西亞舉行的婚宴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/901285f82deacb7f0f7a01d0cd301ce0/2026-08/22_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕早前分享照片，留言：「無端端被人拉入警察局。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11b8bb593eec9cf1ed1816a1e2391419/2026-08/NANCY_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民在小紅書分享早前在黃埔捕獲薛家燕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9478458e03bd4ecf7863257e634edc68/2026-08/NANCY_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕早前於佐敦地鐵站被網民捕獲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb3fd4362d32fba4339346db31588ba5/2025-10/01_0_27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕經常獲邀去各地登台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/818921dc3ec1830d1ef91139ff32cbdb/2024-05/kayinsit_1709535037_3316142703292432183_1237608089.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕也極受廣告商歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f110abb9983c744511480a0953403dca/2024-05/VS--kayinsitInstagram-0_03_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕是圈中著名富婆之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/44feb7da60cdaf0fd7803e95fb0aba08/2023-07/_dsc7677.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕的身家估計逾億。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebddeea5131b4db06f9e88641a35d534/2023-07/imgm7094.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕1996年復出拍《真情》後人氣再次急升，同年購入殷樺花園一個中層單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9760618147ab2b88d544cf57a1d36f7a/2024-05/270190053_4622466404499817_6436988116739529034_n_7736621036202436d14b6c-1024x1024_jpg.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕曾在同屋苑購入三個單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8c2f3bc2336690d82ecdfc34162c0b7/2024-05/S3_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕住在西半山豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/86b7ed33c053b6cd26af16cf8d0a0d6b/2022-10/8ca27101-9fd8-426a-97d0-3d6dc172f131.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕曾公開家中環境。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ab16f7b7fd46cc32f69c836082409c3/2024-05/7QXQdxjMSzNuVRa4UUCZsQEgGSyNt3Km3Xd24N13duA.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曾有內地地產經紀在小紅書分享薛家燕睇樓的短片，更大爆薛家燕辦理收樓手續。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bec52100774724d373d657dc2bd8c619/2023-07/nancy_cap%20%287%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕收樓時再購入多一個單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7cd618457fd6dcbf1e7d21ee22b7e343/2023-07/nancy_cap_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網上片段見到薛家燕睇樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/211a992ddfcbc8e08f48931ed851ff82/2023-07/nancy_cap_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕認真參觀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5ed3d4b83327db5a82711eb54bfa56c/2023-07/nancy_cap_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕直認在大灣區買樓，更指40多萬人民幣的單位「好抵買」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd5b75472df094b5b1cac39dc5996a41/2025-01/nancy_cap_11.jpg\"/>\n<h2>薛家燕傳手持9物業身家逾億</h2>\n<p>薛家燕一向投資有道，盛傳她身家過億，名下更手持至少9個物業，是名副其實的富婆。早在1996年至2009年間，薛家燕便先後入市購入西半山殷樺花園三個單位，2018年兒子石耀庭成家立室時，薛家燕更豪氣送出相鄰單位予兒子一家三口居住，至2008年薛家燕又斥資約300萬元買入觀塘逾2,000呎工廈單位打造「家燕媽媽藝術中心」，其後再斥千萬增持同層擴充版圖。近年薛家燕順應潮流轉戰大灣區，以40多萬人民幣於廣東中山連掃兩伙，與佘詩曼結成鄰居。如今薛家燕再度高調出動睇樓，不少網民紛紛表示羨慕：「薛家燕又買樓，真係富貴逼人」。</p>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕兒子石耀庭在2018年娶老婆Zoe。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c77a3181bd83481ee64d34f822492db/2023-03/34604284_864051287117898_696096649721675776_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕當時豪擲4,000萬娶新抱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/35f888e4e10c5b8c36869aa1e7a5735a/2023-03/7v3x3028.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕榮升奶奶排場極豪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbbeca6f57dfa4f635c0af1ad35e808f/2023-03/thumb_2d3ba741-f769-412e-8310-c77b888be3b3_1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕兒子石耀庭的太太於2021年5月誕下囝囝Julian。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8818443cbcded577cba0ccdaf0e7cf6a/2023-03/195221405_3984363058299166_3398427582181734420_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"石耀庭2018年與Zoe結婚，薛家燕即安排隔壁單位給他們居住。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c877ae53a2cf3e900570d468d292fcd/2024-05/8_G1IXuhiIMkjO2tj5ECXXF9Z8JJeQWHe9drpnvXa6Y.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕榮升嫲嫲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/503b25a48b4632b4634b8143bfd12424/2023-03/193283168_351489856309360_4236859812243847087_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕的好奶奶形象深入民心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e53699522d2fed606b237380d80c9682/2024-05/fTkwbGBQhhWSfuIZodV3fzSQYOkLcAFJ9eWmF_Xlphc.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕兒子一家三口。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/204bc9825408219276be7b8ceafcd6e2/2024-05/s7saCRKmsitye91ygUBPdHSty6LksgFEWpMv3VqTL90.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕曾分享孫仔100日時的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13b472fe3afac94cf24485c951ec205c/2025-01/Nancy_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕囝囝一家三口好幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93da350d5ae2d106e742fed24a5ad79b/2024-05/HZCOmDHQp5_55nNrCxCSaGz9PnYIQcdIz2wYzs9sGM4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕視孫仔如珠如寶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4576a154ccf5b0e57d0ef346fc6522c/2025-01/Nancy_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕不時分享孫仔的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a2cd13b623eda0948a6a1bd4df9c27e9/2025-01/Nancy_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕演出後獲孫仔送花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf905d163eb9d2c65c58e030d34bb3af/2025-01/Nancy_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕收到孫仔送花冧到爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2be97b25718024fb052df13085b83dab/2025-01/Nancy_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕曾與孫仔去日本旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fda08a90f6749a7a60d5557b49c77133/2025-02/SIT_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕大晒全家福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a12a197355e9623077e5a7bda26364ca/2025-02/SIT_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕一家人感情好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9490714ca281c12711f93a9dd6cecbfd/2025-01/Nancy_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕不時與家人聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c91ff55022279592fc4eb576797894c3/2025-02/441245110_18436912792040090_1636986396380054510_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕與前夫離婚後，獨力湊大三個子女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac7391b81c8b9f494f7126276423b7fc/2024-02/FB_IMG_1642492353817.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕離婚時，曾一度想輕生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cccc6f011a263ef35701118a3807b3df/2023-03/img_0420.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕曾面對丈夫出軌、拋妻棄子，終於苦盡甘來。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c0febb2816a596771c96ac9f63555b1/2024-02/3_3_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕的三個仔女已長大成才。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b5d51dcefb1afd0cfc05ad1c3055c1a/2023-03/whatsappimage2020-05-12at10.34.02am.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕早前分享孫仔的照片，小朋友極似爸爸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f8c5e41c930271d562ffcecb1980670/2025-01/Nancy_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕早前到加拿大拍攝，大讚此行舒適。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a708a92ea91c26734760adc538fd2dde/2025-01/Nancy_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕坐商務位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a28d13ac156950867e3d8e20ca4fb19e/2025-01/Nancy_26_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T01:29:21.660120+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":702,"images":52,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}